abstract: "Open parser and derived liquidity measures for all equities listed on the Nigerian Exchange, {{first_date}} to {{last_date}}: security-month Amihud illiquidity, zero-return share and turnover, daily market totals and weekly broker-concentration indices, built from the NGX Data Library with a published QA log. The code rebuilds the full security-day panel from NGX public reports."
